            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0005",
              "x": 208,
              "y": 28,
              "name": "窗口标题",
              "fill": "#E7B85B",
              "effect": {
                "type": "shadow",
                "shadowType": "outer",
                "color": "#1A120A99",
                "offset": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 2
                },
                "blur": 2
              },
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 300,
              "content": "EraWheel 将领系统",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0006",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 206,
              "name": "介绍标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "将领系统是什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0007",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 252,
              "name": "介绍正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "将领是魔王阵营的精英单位，作用像魔王真正降临前的前锋和支柱。\n它不负责持续出波，而是在苏醒阶段一次性进入前线。\n玩家主要通过图鉴、单位详情和运行态查看名单与幸存情况。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0009",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 404,
              "name": "流程标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "将领什么时候出现",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0010",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 450,
              "name": "流程正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "1. 预兆：只衰减将领封印，不生成将领。\n2. 苏醒：将领封印归零后，每个本轮魔王固定生成 5 名将领。\n3. 降临：将领继续参战，配合魔王本体形成最终压力。\n4. 战后重建：本轮将领状态、据点绑定和存活记录被清理。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0012",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 606,
              "name": "系统入口标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "固定规则",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "general_ui_0013",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 652,
              "name": "系统入口正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "每个魔王固定 5 名将领。\n将领只在苏醒阶段生成一次，死亡后不补员。\n将领名单只从《将领名册》读取，本系统不新增独立可调参数。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
